translate italian danas5_0d0211a1:

    # cw "Not as many places as I'd like to, unfortunately."
    cw "Non in tanti posti quanti vorrei, purtroppo."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaConversation/danas5.rpy:16
translate italian danas5_707caefa:

    # cw "My family was pretty poor growing up, so I really only stayed in Georgia."
    cw "La mia famiglia era piuttosto povera quando ero piccola, quindi in realtà sono rimasta solo in Georgia."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaConversation/danas5.rpy:17
translate italian danas5_b3fd01e1:

    # cw "We would go to the beach occasionally, but that's it."
    cw "Ogni tanto andavamo al mare, ma niente di più."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaConversation/danas5.rpy:18
translate italian danas5_eb11089b:

    # cw "In college, I went on a trip with some friends to New York City. That was a lot of fun."
    cw "All’università ho fatto un viaggio con alcuni amici a New York City. È stato molto divertente."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaConversation/danas5.rpy:19
translate italian danas5_54616b93:

    # cw "And Terry and I went on a Caribbean cruise with his parents last year."
    cw "E l’anno scorso io e Terry abbiamo fatto una crociera ai Caraibi con i suoi genitori."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaConversation/danas5.rpy:21
translate italian danas5_239ab5c3:

    # cw "That was NOT a fun trip."
    cw "Quello NON è stato un viaggio divertente."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaConversation/danas5.rpy:22
translate italian danas5_e6cbeb62:

    # pc "No? Why not?"
    pc "No? Perché no?"

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaConversation/danas5.rpy:23
translate italian danas5_487f148e:

    # cw "I don't want to get into it too much, but instead of sharing a bed with Terry, my fiancé..."
    cw "Non voglio dilungarmi troppo, ma invece di dividere il letto con Terry, il mio fidanzato..."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaConversation/danas5.rpy:24
translate italian danas5_cf74209b:

    # cw "They insisted that we had to sleep separately, so I shared a bed with his mom."
    cw "Hanno insistito che dovevamo dormire separati, quindi ho diviso il letto con sua madre."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaConversation/danas5.rpy:25
translate italian danas5_0814c999:

    # cw "It was just awful. If you could imagine the most unromantic cruise trip vacation, this was worse."
    cw "È stato semplicemente orribile. Se riusciste a immaginare la vacanza in crociera meno romantica in assoluto, questa è stata peggio."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaConversation/danas5.rpy:26
translate italian danas5_35431d61:

    # pc "Sounds like it."
    pc "Sembra proprio di sì."

# game/Scenes/Dana/DanaConversation/danas5.rpy:28
translate italian danas5_120046db:

    # cw "Anyway, that's the only places I've ever been, besides here of course."
    cw "Comunque, questi sono gli unici posti in cui sono mai stata, a parte qui ovviamente."

